msgid "Quartz Theme"
msgstr "Quartz 主题"

msgid "Appearance options for the QuartzWrt LuCI theme. Changes take effect on the next page load."
msgstr "QuartzWrt LuCI 主题的外观选项，保存后在下次页面加载时生效。"

msgid "Appearance"
msgstr "外观"

msgid "Content panels turn translucent when opacity is below 100%, and backdrop blur engages automatically."
msgstr "不透明度低于 100% 时，内容面板转为半透明并自动启用毛玻璃。"

msgid "Panel opacity"
msgstr "内容面板不透明度"

msgid "Opacity of content sections and cards, in percent. Lower values let the wallpaper show through."
msgstr "内容区段与卡片的透明度（百分比），数值越低壁纸透出越明显。"

msgid "Blur strength"
msgstr "模糊强度"

msgid "Backdrop blur for the sidebar, top bar and translucent panels, in pixels."
msgstr "侧边栏、顶栏与半透明面板的背景模糊量（像素）。"

msgid "Default appearance"
msgstr "默认外观"

msgid "Applied to first-time visitors; a choice made in the browser overrides it."
msgstr "首次访问时采用的默认外观；在浏览器中手动选择过则以手动为准。"

msgid "Follow system"
msgstr "跟随系统"

msgid "Dark"
msgstr "深色"

msgid "Light"
msgstr "浅色"
